1
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:05,641
You killed my Rahul…

2
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:10,707
He was coughing blood, and you sent him home without treating him.

3
00:00:11,107 --> 00:00:13,506
Two days… only two days.

4
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:16,623
The Singh family will never forgive you.

5
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:27,181
Kabir Rao believes hospitals exist for people who cannot pay.

6
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:30,142
That is why he chose Grace Loan Memorial Hospital

7
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,209
— famous across Dehradun for free treatment,

8
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,800
and one of the few private hospitals on the government's State

9
00:00:34,662 --> 00:00:36,084
Pro Bono Care Scheme.

10
00:00:36,266 --> 00:00:38,563
Five months in, his work is filing,

11
00:00:38,641 --> 00:00:40,223
data entry and errands.

12
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,375
On Monday, the thirtieth of November,

13
00:00:42,339 --> 00:00:44,035
he is handed one more dull job:

14
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:47,046
clear out a month of old voicemails from the hospital's line.

15
00:00:47,236 --> 00:00:49,317
He has no idea it will put him in the middle

16
00:00:49,179 --> 00:00:51,442
of the biggest scandal the hospital has ever hidden.

17
00:00:52,714 --> 00:00:55,955
From the outside, Grace Loan is everything Kabir hoped for.

18
00:00:56,174 --> 00:00:59,132
A two-hundred-and-ten-bed hospital on Rajpur Road.

19
00:00:59,339 --> 00:01:01,239
A motto of 'healing without barriers'.

20
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:04,018
A Director who says no patient is ever turned away for

21
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,621
want of money.

22
00:01:07,489 --> 00:01:11,070
patient it treats — and its website boasts of hundreds of free treatments.

23
00:01:07,489 --> 00:01:11,070
patient it treats — and its website boasts of hundreds of free treatments.

24
00:01:11,272 --> 00:01:14,353
But a twelve-year-old boy named Rahul came here for help…

25
00:01:14,910 --> 00:01:16,969
and two days later, he was dead.

26
00:01:19,137 --> 00:01:21,196
Now, you are Kabir Rao.

27
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:23,672
You have one and a half hours to crack the case

28
00:01:23,136 --> 00:01:25,797
— to find out what is really happening to the pro

29
00:01:25,659 --> 00:01:27,819
bono patients, and who is behind it.

30
00:01:28,576 --> 00:01:29,646
Follow the clues.

31
00:01:29,875 --> 00:01:32,071
Answer every question in the Google Form.

32
00:01:32,264 --> 00:01:34,414
Your investigation begins… now.
